routerd2 native IPv6 Router Advertisement client

This package is original routerd2 code, released under the repository's
BSD-3-Clause license. Its protocol behavior is implemented from RFC 4861,
RFC 4862, RFC 4191 and RFC 8106. It does not copy a separate RA client daemon.

The comparative routerd source used during this migration is pinned at:
  repository: https://github.com/imksoo/routerd
  revision: 1329ef54f296507eda79bbbc3b853783dd27251e

The original routerd reference is used to identify migration requirements;
no old routerd controller or external command runner is linked by this package.
The netlink library is used for read-only interface/address inspection.
Kernel and dependency licenses remain distributed by the repository's existing
license-manifest process. Test fixture mutations run only in isolated namespaces
or a no-NIC QEMU guest and are not part of the production worker.
